<title>USA: Franklin Resources boosts quarterly payout.</title>
<headline>Franklin Resources boosts quarterly payout.</headline>
<dateline>SAN MATEO, Calif. 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarterly</p>
<p>			  Latest		     Prior</p>
<p> Amount		  $0.12		     $0.11</p>
<p> Pay		January 15</p>
<p> Record	  December 31</p>
<p>Note: Full name of company is Franklin Resources Inc.</p>
<p>The dividend above is on a pre-split basis. Taking into account a 3-for-2 stock split, the new dividend will be $0.08 a share.</p>
</text>
